        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Arioko guri gaanslár huúw dír geeraá waawutmo iri oó', «Waawutmoó xiríf, heé ngwaa sláw baraá tlahhoó Yuda wa ale kudá' tinda loohatís, inós tlataadá' ngi waagweer.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Danieli kudá' taa báy Belteshasa guri yaahaás guri báy, «Xáy kuúng tlataaeé' kudaádá' naa ár iqo tsuwa asleéra ngiwa xu'utis nee ngiwa waagwet?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli waawutmo guri báy, «Kángw naaqoodá' waawutmo aa yaahaás heé waagweeraro gu asláw i kaahh, tam ku sageeloén laqaá da/alusmo laqaá qwaslaarmo, laqaá qwaslaarér xu'utuusér kángw tsatse/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú i deer gawaá dooriwo oo kángw naaqo gu geehhooatimís. Inós muruú aluú wá hi'iít oo deelór alhhe'eesaay ngwa laqán, aá waawutmo Nebukadnésa. Tlataawók nee iigu'utuú taa aán gawaá qatanirók wa alé a kwí:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aá waawutámo, kuúng qoomár tawa gu' ana tlatiitiín daanduú kángw alúwá hi'iít, nee Munguúdá' naaqór geehhooetimís kangwdá' tleehharuút ngwaa dirók i laqán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng gár tsaahhár naaqoorí ngisa sláw a kaahaaká as aníng tawa heé sagaloó' ta múk hatlá' oo slafa, aasla'áy, ala a as kuúng tuwa xu'utisi nee inslawoó baraá muunaáwók kuwa xu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuúng waawutámo, murslaaqatuú yangaariír una aán, slám i gwa/aat ló'wa aleeró, ina sihhiít geeraawók i alé, nee bura aán i lo'wá dae tlaaq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagós kuna tleéhh ar sahaábuú hhohhó', da/eewaawós nee dabaawo a muqslidá' ta peésár wa tlehhaahhiti, tla/aangós nee guruuwose a muqslír sirdaa/aat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya'aawós a muqsli nee kunda'aá ya'aawós a aledoogír muqsla nee tleei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár kuúng kuwa ga/eer naxés tlaa/ár taa dákwár tsatiiká nina kilós /akút, ya'aá murslaaqatuudá' awa aleedoogír muqsli nee tleei giri dalá/, niri suwawaa'atiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy muqslidá' nee tleeiro nee muqslír sirdaa/aate nee muqslidár peésaaro nee sahaábuwo niri suwawaa'atiyé', tari adór muundoó dír afeenír balaangw kuwa haritleemamisi. Parhheemaá aáng fur'a giri ar tlatleér tam kiri aandaaká. Ala tlaa/anoó aáng kudá' murslaaqatuudá' gwa dalaa/ ina tloomar yangaariir tleehhiít, yaamu sleémeero giri dalaá/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tlataawók kudaádá' a kuká', aá waawutámo, nee gár i kaahiya' án ngi alki/iít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng waawutámo a waawutmoó waawitá, Munguú doori kuúng ugwa waawuti'iimár i haniís nee aleesleemu nee /uuru nee xirif. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú dír muu i hooti nee makaá sla/ato, nee tsir/ooro ngaa dabaawók i qaás, inós kuúng una baalusmooín wa qaás. Kuúng nee waawuti'iimaroge an sagwduú sahaábu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá waawuti'iimaroge waawuti'iimár hatlá' ni iitleér ar daqa tlaakw dír toge, nee aluudae waawuti'iimár tám, ar muqslír sirdaa/aat, xoordu sleémeero gi sawaawuti'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawuti'iimár tsiyáhh i /uuruú koón adór muqslír wa alé. Asma muqsli umuú gaaro ga geeqeér gay hhitiín, an adór waawuti'iimadá' i diri', waawuti'iima sleémeero ar aa waarahh gan hhitiín gari suwa tsát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee adoodá' kunda'aá ya'a' kira aán nee ditsaaine awa aleedogír tleei nee muqsli, gaarí gár i laqaqaan a waawuti'iimarqá' tin afle sí', ala baraawose /uuruú muqsli i kumiit adoodá' kara aán, ala a aleedoogír muqsli nee tleei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee ditsaá taa aán adór i dirii'iya' a aleedoogír muqsli nee tleei, waawuti'iimadá' sleeme i baraaka /uuruú koón nee i baraaka slanáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' muqslír aáng taa aán ar taa haragaás nee tleei, adoorí gár i kat a waawituú aáng tin haragaasiyá' ar loohír duuxo, ala tiqo baloó oohiaaká, ar adór muqsli nee tleei tir oohiaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "De'emaá waawuti'iimasinge, Munguú doori waawuti'iima ga sihhtis ar ta hhitinká kureeriwo nee arta baloó baliiká nee múk hatlá', ala waawuti'iimarí waawuti'iimár hatlá' sleémeero gan parhhamís gari hhitiín, nee waawuti'iimarí in kumaamít ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaa/a ana aán ar naa kilós tsatit gawaá tloomár wa alé, ar hee aa kwatitiiká. Muqslír aáng gana suwaawá', nee muqslír sirdaa/aate nee tleeiro nee muqslidár peesaaro nee sahaábuwo. Gawaá adoorihe Munguúdá' úr kaangwí ngwa dirógí xu'utís, waawutámo, a kángw tlehharuút aluúwaá ale. Tlataaká' awa ló', nee gár i kaahiya' ar ló' sleeme.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Nebukadnesa giti gari yaamúr óh, Danieli guri i tumbarara'aát, hara'aya gari oó' Danieli kuwa ilahhooár i haniisi nee mooyangwdá' tsuua sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Danieli guri báy, «Ar ló', Munguúhúng ku úr ta munguaá hatlae, nee a baalusmoó waawitá, kángw baraá naaqo gu aleesláy geehhooeesaro, asma kuúng kángw naaqoorí ugwa aleesleér geehhooeesaro.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Danieli guri xirfayeés, guri muruú yaariír i haniís, guri waawuti'iimár yaamaá Babulonírí haniís. Guri geeraharusmoó hara'ayuuse sleémeero ar waawutmoó wa qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám Danieli waawutmo guri firín as Shadraki, nee Meshaki, nee Abednego kiwa uráy haniisi baraá yaamaá Babuloniro. Ala Danieli ina meét dír bihhaá waawutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
